EVALUATION

Anyone may download the app and run it to evaluate it, for as long as they
like, with every feature. A copy without a license says it is evaluating and
now and then reminds its user to buy one.

LICENSES

A license is a signed block of text that Lunch Time Surf LLC sends a buyer
by email. Entered into the app, it lets the people it covers use the app
without the reminders.

- A Personal license is for one person, and is bought by that person. It
  covers that person's use of the app on all of their machines. It does not
  cover use at a company.

- A Commercial license is for use at a company, and has a number of seats.
  Each seat covers one person's use of the app, on as many machines as that
  person uses it on. A company may move a seat from a person who has stopped
  using the app to another.

The people a license covers may copy the app onto the machines it covers
them on.

UPDATES

A license covers every version of the app released on or before the
Updates-Until date in its block, for as long as its holder likes. A version
released after that date runs as an evaluation until a new license covers
it.

REFUNDS

A license may be refunded in full within 30 days of its purchase, as
https://rewindvm.dev/refunds.html says. A refunded license is revoked:
versions of the app released after the refund refuse it.

